  "title": "最高人民法院关于审理拐卖妇女案件适用法律有关问题的解释",
  "category": "司法解释",
  "issuingAuthority": "最高人民法院",
  "promulgationDate": "2000-01-03",
  "effectiveDate": "2000-01-25",
  "status": "effective",
  "source": {
    "metadataPath": "data/laws/sfjs-0a3eb3ed9a/metadata.json",
